Midranda's warriors, rescued from the Shadow Road, are fewer in number. But they thirst for revenge.
Power has gone to their heads, making them lose control.
Zarad was reckless. His warriors, defeated in battle, became enemies when they were revived by the Water of Life manipulated by Midranda.

Please, help Arteres and Ceres investigate the area of the Sanctuary of the Abyss; we need all the information we can get to plan our attack strategy.

Go to the marked area in the Sanctuary of the Abyss. A light will mark the place.

Talk to Sage Celina after gathering the information.
